  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Orchestrate Shipping and Logistics with Camunda and EasyPost",
    "splashDescription": "The EasyPost Connector merges Camunda's best-of-breed process orchestration capabilities with EasyPost's robust shipping and logistics services. This Connector is ideal for teams that want to automate shipping-related workflows; it ensures a more streamlined, efficient, and trackable shipping process.",
